Date: Fri, 14 Nov 2025 14:04:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 4/7] constraints: Add external constraints interface

This adds a new type interface for constraints.

Part-of: <https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/mutter/-/merge_requests/4692>
(cherry picked from commit 17b6a69868a38240a9e179239310dc55ae9202d5)
---
